'''''Mother, Parted by the Turning of Seasons''''' is a [[Trailblaze Mission]] in the chapter [[For the Sun is Set to Die]].

==Steps==
# Reach Path Space
# Pass through the Gate of Memory
# Speak with Fu Xuan
# Follow Fu Xuan
# Meet with your friends
# Follow your friends to pass through the Gate of Memory
# Follow Fu Xuan

